  "description": "Perhaps the strategy of 'Sprout Pharmacy', which uses four handsome pharmacists with different styles, was overdone, as the number of customers increased day by day, pharmacy manager 'Chan-Young Ko' decided to hire a female part-timer with the goal of reducing customers. Just when we were about to hire applicants who exactly fit our goals! 'Seo Young' comes down on the building owner's grandfather's parachute line...\"Why do I have to hire that bastard woman!?\"\n\n**Original Webtoon**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=792645), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8246456)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0002117)",
